        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "你是歷史學家。請從以下多個來源中抽取該公司的重要歷史里程碑或事件。\n輸出必須是一個 JSON 數組，每個對象包含：\n{\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD (or YYYY)\",\n  \"event\": \"事件描述\"\n}\n如果沒有發現具體事件，請返回空數組 []。\n\n來源文字：\n{{ $json.allText }}"
            },
            "id": "ai_synthesis",
            "name": "AI Synthesis",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.basicLlmChain",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                700,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "try {\n  const text = $input.item.json.text.replace(/```json|```/g, \"\").trim();\n  const events = JSON.parse(text);\n  return events.map(e => ({ json: e }));\n} catch (e) {\n  return [];\n}"
            },
            "id": "parse_events",
            "name": "Parse Events",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                900,
                300
